sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Payment verified
    participant P2 as payment.succeeded event
    participant P3 as Wallet consumer
    participant P4 as Unique event ledger
    participant P5 as Balance projection
    P1->>P2: Verify success event
    P2->>P3: Publish versioned event
